From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:30:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] drm/etnaviv: Add the hwdb entry for the Allwinner A733 NPU

The NPU of the Allwinner A733 identifies as model 0x9000, revision
0x9202, product 0x05090009, customer 0x1000003b, eco 0x08000000. There
is no hwdb entry for it, so the driver falls back to the feature
registers, which read as zero on this core.

Add the entry. It is derived from the entry of this core in the vendor
feature database, vip9000nano-di. The feature words are filled the way
the existing entries are: the first seven words follow the bit order of
the database, the others are matched by feature name. That procedure
reproduces the existing 0x8000 entries from their database entries. The
specs are the database values for streams, registers, threads, shader
cores, NN cores, vertex cache and output buffer, pixel pipes,
instructions, constants and varyings.

Not covered: the database flags that have no feature bit in
common.xml.h.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the driver matches the
entry and reports its feature words and specs.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/etnaviv/etnaviv_hwdb.c | 32 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 32 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/etnaviv/etnaviv_hwdb.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/etnaviv/etnaviv_hwdb.c
index 32d710baf17f..a6aecb6194dc 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/etnaviv/etnaviv_hwdb.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/etnaviv/etnaviv_hwdb.c
@@ -292,6 +292,38 @@ static const struct etnaviv_chip_identity etnaviv_chip_identities[] = {
 		.minor_features10 = 0x108048c0,
 		.minor_features11 = 0x00000010,
 	},
+	{
+		.model = 0x9000,
+		.revision = 0x9202,
+		.product_id = 0x5090009,
+		.customer_id = 0x1000003b,
+		.eco_id = 0x8000000,
+		.stream_count = 8,
+		.register_max = 64,
+		.thread_count = 256,
+		.shader_core_count = 1,
+		.nn_core_count = 8,
+		.vertex_cache_size = 16,
+		.vertex_output_buffer_size = 1024,
+		.pixel_pipes = 1,
+		.instruction_count = 512,
+		.num_constants = 320,
+		.buffer_size = 0,
+		.varyings_count = 16,
+		.features = 0xe0287cac,
+		.minor_features0 = 0xc1799eff,
+		.minor_features1 = 0xfefbfadb,
+		.minor_features2 = 0xeb9d6fbf,
+		.minor_features3 = 0xedfffced,
+		.minor_features4 = 0xd30dafc7,
+		.minor_features5 = 0x7b5ac333,
+		.minor_features6 = 0xfc8ee200,
+		.minor_features7 = 0x03fffa6f,
+		.minor_features8 = 0x00fe0ef0,
+		.minor_features9 = 0x0088003c,
+		.minor_features10 = 0x10c0c0c0,
+		.minor_features11 = 0x00000010,
+	},
 };
 
 bool etnaviv_fill_identity_from_hwdb(struct etnaviv_gpu *gpu)
